     the only creatures on earth that can decompose lignin, so in order to better analyze fungal
     activity, we only consider the effect of this point on wood decomposition.
 ⚫   The effect of fungi on all stages of wood decomposition is consistent with the middle
     stage of wood decay cycle. According to the Research Article Synopsis provided by the
     problem, fungi are most associated with the decay of woody materials in the middle of their
     decay cycle. Therefore, for the purpose of modeling exercise, we make this assumption.




